            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>60</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[200, 500, 60, 90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La console qui sotto mostra <code>60</code> per il codice così com'è scritto. Che cosa visualizzerebbe se <code>60</code> venisse rimosso da <code>light_intensity</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(light_intensity))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>90</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>"
