          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dovrebbe essere <code>active_users.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è nulla di sbagliato nel codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Possiamo usare <code>sort()</code> solo all'interno di un'istruzione <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dovrebbe essere <code>active_users.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale sostituzione della seconda riga ordina <code>active_users</code> dal valore più piccolo al più grande?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sort(active_users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>active_users.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sort(active_users)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>active_users = sort()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>active_users.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
