            "id": 82860,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dovrebbe essere <code>sum(cart)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo usare <code>sum()</code>, perché <code>cart</code> non è una lista</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è nulla di sbagliato nel codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dovrebbe essere <code>sum(cart)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale sostituzione della seconda riga fa visualizzare al codice il totale del carrello, <code>87</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart.sum())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(sum(cart))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(max(cart))</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(cart.sum())</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print(sum(cart))</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
